#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Accounting:</b> Manage tax compliance natively by tracking purchase and "
"sales data to automate and calculate the VAT margin scheme for second-hand "
"goods."
msgstr ""
"<b>Akuntansi:</b> Kelola kepatuhan pajak secara native dengan melacak data "
"Pembelian dan Sales untuk mengotomatiskan dan menghitung skema margin PPN "
"untuk barang bekas."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Audit your \"To Qualify\" stock:</b> Set up a weekly routine to review "
"products sitting in the \"to qualify\" state. Bottlenecks here tie up "
"capital; moving them quickly through the conversion process keeps your cash "
"flow healthy."
msgstr ""
"<b>Periksa stok \"To Qualify\" Anda:</b> Buat rutinitas mingguan untuk "
"meninjau produk yang berada dalam status \"to qualify\". Hambatan di sini "
"mengikat modal; memprosesnya dengan cepat melalui proses konversi akan "
"menjaga arus kas Anda tetap sehat."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"<b>Bring voice-activated productivity directly into your office, warehouse, "
"or boardroom.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Hadirkan produktivitas berbasis suara langsung ke kantor, gudang, atau "
"ruang rapat Anda.</b>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Bring your team together or reward your top performers with a console "
"engineered for the modern tech enthusiast.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Satukan tim Anda atau berikan penghargaan kepada karyawan berprestasi "
"terbaik dengan konsol yang dirancang khusus untuk penggemar teknologi modern."
"</b>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid "<b>Empower your team. Upgrade your workflow today.</b>"
msgstr "<b>Berdayakan tim Anda. Tingkatkan alur kerja Anda hari ini.</b>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Enforce serial number scanning:</b> Always require your warehouse and "
"retail staff to scan serial numbers rather than selecting them manually. "
"This drastically reduces human error and ensures the correct financial cost "
"is pulled during the sale."
msgstr ""
"<b>Terapkan pemindaian nomor seri:</b> Selalu wajibkan staf gudang dan ritel "
"Anda untuk memindai nomor seri daripada memilihnya secara manual. Hal ini "
"secara drastis mengurangi kesalahan manusia dan memastikan biaya keuangan "
"yang tepat diambil selama proses penjualan."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"<b>Give your business a voice. Deploy Hellodoo in your workspace today.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Berikan suara bagi bisnis Anda. Terapkan Hellodoo di ruang kerja Anda "
"hari ini.</b>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Give your workspace a touch of fun. Add the GameX Extreme to your "
"inventory today.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tambahkan sentuhan keseruan pada ruang kerja Anda. Tambahkan GameX "
"Extreme ke Inventaris Anda hari ini.</b>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory:</b> Trace serial numbers and utilize conversion tools to "
"transform generic or ungraded items into market-ready, condition-graded "
"stock."
msgstr ""
"<b>Inventaris:</b> Lacak nomor seri dan manfaatkan alat konversi untuk "
"mengubah barang generik atau yang belum diberi peringkat menjadi stok yang "
"siap dijual dan telah diberi peringkat kondisi."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>MRP (Manufacturing)</b> app provides advanced routing and bill of "
"materials management for deep refurbishment processes;"
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi MRP (Produksi)</b> menyediakan manajemen rute dan bill of "
"material tingkat lanjut untuk proses perbaikan menyeluruh;"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Purchase:</b> Procure incoming second-hand electronics, manage supplier "
"orders, and accurately record the initial condition or categorization of "
"your newly acquired inventory."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pembelian:</b> Dapatkan barang elektronik bekas yang masuk, kelola "
"pesanan pemasok, dan catat dengan akurat kondisi awal atau kategorisasi "
"Inventaris yang baru Anda peroleh."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reconcile often:</b> Do not wait until the end of the fiscal year to run "
"your VAT Margin regularization. Doing this monthly or quarterly ensures your "
"tax liabilities are always transparent and manageable."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lakukan rekonsiliasi secara rutin:</b> Jangan menunda hingga akhir tahun "
"fiskal untuk melakukan regulasi Margin PPN. Melakukannya setiap bulan atau "
"triwulan memastikan kewajiban pajak Anda selalu transparan dan terkendali."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Repair</b> app to seamlessly handle customer returns, screen "
"replacements, or warranty claims on previously sold devices. If your testing "
"benches involve complex disassembly and component harvesting;"
msgstr ""
"<b>Perbaiki aplikasi \"</b> \" agar dapat menangani pengembalian barang "
"pelanggan, penggantian layar, atau klaim garansi pada perangkat yang telah "
"terjual dengan lancar. Jika bangku pengujian Anda melibatkan pembongkaran "
"yang rumit dan pemanenan komponen;"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sales / eCommerce:</b> Showcase available graded inventory, prevent "
"overselling out-of-stock devices, and dynamically adjust pricing based on "
"specific product condition attributes."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sales / eCommerce:</b> Tampilkan inventaris barang yang telah dinilai, "
"cegah penjualan berlebih perangkat yang kehabisan stok, dan sesuaikan harga "
"secara dinamis berdasarkan atribut kondisi produk tertentu."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardize condition attributes:</b> Keep your grading scale simple and "
"easy to understand for the consumer (e.g., Fair, Good, Premium). Too many "
"micro-grades will clutter your eCommerce store and confuse your testing "
"technicians."
msgstr ""
"<b>Standarkan atribut kondisi:</b> Jaga agar skala penilaian Anda tetap "
"sederhana dan mudah dipahami oleh konsumen (misalnya, Fair, Good, Premium). "
"Terlalu banyak sub-penilaian akan membuat toko eCommerce Anda berantakan dan "
"membingungkan teknisi pengujian Anda."

