"pulling up daily KPIs during a morning stand-up, Hellodoo bridges the gap "
"between your physical workspace and your digital ERP."
msgstr ""
"Ubah cara tim Anda berinteraksi dengan data mereka. Baik itu pemeriksaan "
"inventaris cepat di lantai gudang, mengatur timer di ruang istirahat, atau "
"menampilkan KPI harian selama rapat pagi, Hellodoo menjembatani kesenjangan "
"antara ruang kerja fisik Anda dan sistem ERP digital Anda."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Trigger product conversions on <b>any stock move</b>, allowing technicians "
"to instantly swap a device's identity as soon as it passes the testing bench."
msgstr ""
"Picu konversi produk di <b>setiap pergerakan stok</b>, sehingga teknisi "
"dapat langsung mengganti identitas perangkat begitu perangkat tersebut lulus "
"uji coba."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Turning mystery boxes into valuable assets requires strict traceability. Our "
"technical conversion module empowers your team to seamlessly grade and "
"convert products, establishing the exact condition, value, and identity of "
"every device before it hits the shelves."
msgstr ""
"Mengubah kotak misteri menjadi aset berharga memerlukan keterlacakan yang "
"ketat. Modul konversi teknis kami memberdayakan tim Anda untuk menilai dan "
"mengonversi produk secara mulus, menentukan kondisi, nilai, dan identitas "
"yang tepat dari setiap perangkat sebelum dipasarkan."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid "Ultra-Wide &amp; Macro"
msgstr "Makro \" &amp; \" Ultra-Lebar"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid ""
"Ultra-soft leatherette earpads with memory foam contour your ears for total "
"ergonomic support and natural noise isolation."
msgstr ""
"Bantalan telinga berbahan kulit imitasi ultra-lembut dengan busa memori yang "
"mengikuti kontur telinga Anda untuk dukungan ergonomis total dan isolasi "
"kebisingan alami."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"Unlike consumer smart speakers, Hellodoo processes business commands "
"securely. A dedicated hardware mute button ensures complete confidentiality "
"during sensitive discussions."
msgstr ""
"Tidak seperti speaker pintar untuk konsumen, Hellodoo memproses perintah "
"bisnis dengan aman. Tombol mute khusus pada perangkat keras memastikan "
"kerahasiaan penuh selama diskusi yang sensitif."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid "Up to 40 Hours Continuous Playback"
msgstr "Pemutaran Berkelanjutan Hingga 40 Jam"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr "Contoh Penggunaan"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Accounting app</b> to calculate your product margin over a "
"selected period, filtering\n"
"                specifically for products submitted to the <b>VAT margin "
"scheme</b> (excluding brand-new items)."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan aplikasi Akuntansi <b></b> untuk menghitung margin produk Anda "
"selama periode yang dipilih, dengan menyaring\n"
"                secara khusus produk-produk yang diajukan ke skema margin "
"PPN <b></b> (tidak termasuk barang baru)."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Sales app</b> or <b>eCommerce storefront</b> to list your fully "
"qualified and graded devices."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan aplikasi Sales <b></b> atau etalase eCommerce <b></b> untuk "
"mencantumkan perangkat Anda yang telah memenuhi syarat dan dinilai "
"sepenuhnya."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>Repair app</strong> to create dedicated repair orders by "
"selecting the exact product and its unique serial number."
msgstr ""

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the scrap operation from inventory menu and from transfer to discard "
"devices which are not refurbish-able to maintain your stock neat and "
"accurate."
msgstr ""

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Utilize the seamless <b>product conversions</b> directly from the inventory "
"replenishment screens."
msgstr ""
"Manfaatkan konversi produk \" <b>\" yang mulus</b> langsung dari layar "
"pengisian ulang inventaris."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model:account.tax,invoice_label:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model:account.tax,invoice_label:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
#: model_terms:account.tax,description:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model_terms:account.tax,description:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
msgid "VAT Margin Scheme"
msgstr "Skema Margin PPN"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:account.tax,invoice_legal_notes:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model_terms:account.tax,invoice_legal_notes:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
msgid ""
"VAT Margin Scheme : Supply subject to the special margin scheme. VAT not "
"deductible."
msgstr ""
"Skema Margin PPN: Penyerahan barang/jasa tunduk pada skema margin khusus. "
"PPN tidak dapat dikurangkan."

