msgstr "Pencatatan Suara ke CRM"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid "We collect used devices from businesses and individuals."
msgstr "Kami mengumpulkan perangkat bekas dari perusahaan dan individu."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We have a full range of Grade-A certified devices, fully restored and backed "
"by warranty."
msgstr ""
"Kami memiliki rangkaian lengkap perangkat bersertifikat Grade-A, yang telah "
"dipulihkan sepenuhnya dan didukung oleh garansi."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid "What we refurbish"
msgstr "Apa yang kami perbarui"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When a device is beyond economical repair, component harvesting ensures you "
"still extract maximum value from your inventory. By utilizing the "
"Manufacturing app, you can seamlessly dismantle broken units and recover "
"valuable parts for future repairs or separate sales."
msgstr ""

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:electronic_refurbishment.product_attribute_value_7
msgid "White"
msgstr "Putih"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid "Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Native Odoo IoT Box protocol"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, protokol Odoo IoT Box bawaan"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or explore more features?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda ingin mengadakan diskusi tentang pengaturan Odoo Anda dengan "
"kami atau menjelajahi fitur-fitur lainnya?"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"Wrapped in a premium charcoal acoustic fabric under a matte white shell, the "
"Hellodoo isn't just a smart speaker—it's a hands-free portal to your entire "
"business operations. Designed specifically to integrate seamlessly with the "
"Odoo ecosystem, it allows you to query inventory, schedule meetings, and log "
"CRM notes without ever opening your laptop."
msgstr ""
"Dibalut kain akustik abu-abu premium di bawah cangkang putih matte, Hellodoo "
"bukan sekadar speaker pintar—melainkan portal hands-free ke seluruh operasi "
"bisnis Anda. Dirancang khusus untuk terintegrasi secara mulus dengan "
"ekosistem Odoo, perangkat ini memungkinkan Anda memeriksa inventaris, "
"menjadwalkan rapat, dan mencatat catatan CRM tanpa perlu membuka laptop."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah menyelesaikan contoh penggunaan demo tersebut! Ada jutaan cara "
"lain untuk menyesuaikan pengaturan Odoo Anda agar sesuai dengan kebutuhan "
"bisnis Anda."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You might have tested this package with or without demo data.<br/>\n"
"        In any case, you may have written records in journals which are not "
"deletable and which might be an issue for your traceability."
msgstr ""
"Anda mungkin telah menguji paket ini dengan atau tanpa data demo.<br/>\n"
"        Bagaimanapun, Anda mungkin telah menulis catatan di jurnal yang "
"tidak dapat dihapus dan hal ini mungkin menjadi masalah bagi keterlacakan "
"Anda."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
